ass":504},[490,1202,665],{"class":607},[490,1204,668],{"class":504},[490,1206,1207],{"class":563},"Throwable",[490,1209,566],{"class":504},[490,1211,1212],{"class":500},"error",[490,1214,673],{"class":504},[490,1216,611],{"class":504},[490,1218,1220,1222,1224,1226,1229],{"class":492,"line":1219},26,[490,1221,617],{"class":504},[490,1223,860],{"class":500},[490,1225,622],{"class":504},[490,1227,1228],{"class":556},"rollBack",[490,1230,997],{"class":504},[490,1232,1234,1237,1239,1241],{"class":492,"line":1233},27,[490,1235,1236],{"class":607},"        throw",[490,1238,566],{"class":504},[490,1240,1212],{"class":500},[490,1242,521],{"class":504},[490,1244,1246],{"class":492,"line":1245},28,[490,1247,691],{"class":504},[490,1249,1251],{"class":492,"line":1250},29,[490,1252,697],{"class":504},[468,1254,1255],{},"The second parse inside Fluent is intentional: the first verifies the event ID before deduplication; the processor still verifies every delivery it handles. Adapt the insert to your database's conflict syntax. A lock timeout or deadlock must fail the request and retry, not return success.",[468,1257,1258],{},"Queue emails, provisioning, and other external effects through an outbox committed with the billing writes. Do not send an email inside the transaction: a rollback cannot unsend it. Make outbox consumers idempotent too. Event-ID deduplication handles redelivery of one event; unique entity IDs and idempotent fulfillment rules also protect against different events for the same payment.",[468,1260,1261],{},"Deliveries can arrive out of order. Store-or-update does not prevent an older snapshot overwriting a newer one, and find-or-skip events cannot repair a missing row. Define reconciliation and stale-event handling in your driver. Persist test mode and keep test deliveries away from live access rules.",[702,1263,1265],{"id":1264},"add-application-reactions","Add application reactions",[468,1267,1268,1269,1272,1273,1276,1277,1280,1281,1284],{},"Pass ",[472,1270,1271],{},"WebhookReactionInterface"," implementations in ",[472,1274,1275],{},"Wiring(additionalWebhookReactions: [...])",". They run after built-ins and before the final event dispatch. Typed webhook events live in ",[472,1278,1279],{},"Vatly\\API\\Webhooks\\Events","; local-row-created events live in ",[472,1282,1283],{},"Vatly\\Fluent\\Events",".",[468,1286,1287,1288,1290,1291,1284],{},"Use ",[477,1289,58],{"href":208}," to test signatures, rollback, and retries. For payload fields, see the ",[477,1292,280],{"href":1293,"rel":1294},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference",[1295],"nofollow",[1297,1298,1299],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F78C6C;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .sBMFI, html code.shiki .sBMFI{--shiki-light:#E2931D;--shiki-default:#FFCB6B;--shiki-dark:#FFCB6B}html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-decoration);}html.light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);background: var(--shiki-light-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-light-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-light-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-light-text-d